  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows a block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> sliding at constant speed down an inclined plane. The plane makes an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> with the horizontal.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The coefficient of dynamic friction between the block and the plane is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"μ_{D}\"></span> and the magnitude of the normal reaction force on the block is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"cos^{-1}\\frac{m g}{μ_{D} N}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"cos^{-1}\\frac{μ_{D} N}{m g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\frac{m g}{μ_{D} N}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\frac{μ_{D} N}{m g}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
